  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.PlanetScaleOASIS v2.0.2\n\nConnects the OASIS to PlanetScale (serverless MySQL) using MySqlConnector ADO.NET. Stores OASIS holons and avatars with indexed lookup columns and full JSON blob storage. Compatible with PlanetScale cloud and any MySQL 8+ instance. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.1\n- docs(packages): add missing NuGet guides and release setup sections (77c65ea)\n- feat(providers): add PocketBase, Turso, Appwrite, PlanetScale, OrbitDB, and GUN OASIS providers (4a1f3a1)\n- fix: put every project in a solution and fix the bugs that exposed (4612aa0)\n- fix(packaging): explicitly include newly documented package readmes (5be30be)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Storage/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.PlanetScaleOASIS",
